		width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background-color: #1A73E8;
		margin-top: 7px; margin-right: 8px; flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.bullet-dot-blue { background-color: #1A73E8; }
	.bullet-text { flex: 1; font-size: 13px; color: #1A1A1A; line-height: 20px; }
	.gift-row { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; }
	.gift-chip {
		padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #FFFFFF;
		margin-right: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.gift-chip-text { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A1A1A; }
	.detail-footer {
		flex-direction: row; padding: 10px 16px 18px 16px;
		border-top-width: 0.5px; border-top-color: rgba(60,60,67,0.12);
		flex-shrink: 0; background-color: #FFFFFF;
	}
	.detail-secondary {
		height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 22px; background-color: #FFFFFF;
		align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 10px;
	}
	.detail-secondary-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A1A1A; }
	.detail-primary {
		flex: 1; height: 44px; border-radius: 22px; background-color: #1A73E8;
		align-items: center; justify-content: center;
	}
	.detail-primary-text { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; }
</style>
